  "name": "html-stylesheet-grid-with-plain-wrapper-children",
  "description": "An author grid container (.grid-3 with display:grid and three equal tracks) whose children are plain wrapper divs rather than recognized card markup still emits a native grid layout with columnCount 3, so the multi-column arrangement survives. The layout attribute comes from the resolved cascade, not from the grid-looking class token.",
